OL,3,GNEWSANew Etihad link in 'floating
OL,4,Awalkways' plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a "floating walkway" linking
OL,7,FManchester city centre to the Etihad
OL,8,Fcampus have been revealed.
OL,10,FIt will be part of the #100m CyanLines
OL,11,Fplan to create a 100-mile (161km)
OL,12,Fnetwork of walkways around the Greater
OL,13,FManchester region over the next decade.
OL,15,FThe recently announced route will see
OL,16,Fthe Etihad campus - home to Manchester
OL,17,FCity FC - connected to Piccadilly
OL,18,Fstation, taking in Ashton Canal, New
OL,19,FIslington and Holt Town.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
