OL,3,GNEWSANew Etihad link in 'floating
OL,4,Awalkways' plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreater Manchester mayor Bev Craig
OL,7,Fsaid: "It's not just about travel, the
OL,8,Fwhole point of CyanLines is 100 miles
OL,9,Fof nature connected together, and yes
OL,10,Fit's about how you move, cycle and
OL,11,Fwalk, but it's something more
OL,12,Ffundamental."
